! My Lojban Notebook

My Project Notebook for Lojban-related activity.

* [08 Oct 2010] I've ported [http://en.qi-hardware.com/wiki/User:Alanpost#Packages_I_Help_Maintain|jbofi'e to the Ben NanoNote].
* [07 Oct 2010] I posted Willem's article to the news section on this wiki.
* [07 Oct 2010] Willem Larsen has written an article about construct language and "Where are your Keys?" called [http://whereareyourkeys.org/2010/10/05/the-playful-world-of-conlangs/|The Playful World of Conlangs].  I'm quoted in the article.
* [06 Oct 2010] Behind on everything, I had a non-Lojban deadline to make.
* [05 Oct 2010] I started a game of "I know a girl, ask her anything" on xedbig.
* [05 Oct 2010] A lot of translation work on "le vajrai se tadni" this morning.  Now that I'm playing regularly, this work is going much faster.
* [04 Oct 2010] I spoke to Timo about adding a news item about {lo do ckiku ma zvati}.  .ui Lots of attention for this project recently!
* [04 Oct 2010] Interesting conversation this morning with Willem Larsen, who is preparing some material to talk about constructed languages and "Where are your Keys?".  You'll have to wait for the article for more information!
* [01 Oct 2010] I've created a google group for playing {[http://lodockikumazvati.org/prekarni/2010/10/01_email_play_group/|lo do ckiku ma zvati]}.  My current game has migrated there.
* [30 Sep 2010] I've started a game of [http://groups.google.com/group/xedbig/browse_frm/thread/eac23efdd4c630ed|.i lo lo djaca'i ku mlatu] ([http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Minister%27s_Cat|The Minister's Cat]) on xedbig.  I'm having a lot of fun with it!
* [24 Sep 2010] The [http://groups.google.com/group/xedbig/browse_frm/thread/e471f1ad9f8b52f5|first ever session] of {lo do ckiku ma zvati} was played of Hedwig, with [http://groups.google.com/group/lojban/browse_frm/thread/20777ad21cf38da0|follow-up discussion] happening in the Lojban group.
* [23 Sep 2010] I've created a lojban ((typography)) page summarizing several mailing list conversations.
* [21 Sep 2010] I published an update to le vajrai se tadni based on personal feedback during solo play.
* [19 Sep 2010] I had a chance to play "lo do ckiku ma zvati" and have some edits to make to "le vajrai se tadni" as a result.
* [18 Sep 2010] I'm AFK.
* [17 Sep 2010] I'm AFK.
* [16 Sep 2010] I'm AFK.
* [15 Sep 2010] If I can get away with it, I'm going to play "lo do ckiku ma zvati" in xedbig.
* [15 Sep 2010] I've joined the [http://groups.google.com/group/xedbig?hl=en|xedbig] google group to practice Lojban.
* [13 Sep 2010] I had my first [http://www.lojban.org/resources/irclog/lojban/2010_09_14-02_21.txt|conversation in Lojban] on IRC.
* [13 Sep 2010] I'm [http://www.reddit.com/r/lojban/comments/dd7yr/i_mi_djica_lo_nu_fi_do_cabdei_lisri/|experimenting with Lojban] on [http://reddit.com/|Reddit].
* [12 Sep 2010] I've added a ((Dictionary)) page condensing a conversation from the mailing list.
* [11 Sep 2010] I've shipped off a file to ((Robin Lee Powell)) containing the difference between the print CLL and the [http://github.com/lojban/cll|git CLL].
 
